  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Imaran Khan vs State Of U.P. And 4 Others on 4 January, 2024 Author: Ashwani Kumar Mishra Bench: Ashwani Kumar Mishra High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:1525-Db Court No. - 32 Case :- Writ - C No. - 43859 of 2023 Petitioner :- Imaran Khan Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 4 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Chandra Prakash Garg",
    "facts": "The petitioner appears to be running a shop in which he sells meat etc. According to the petitioner, he has obtained requisite permission from the competent authority under the Food Safety Act, 2006..",
    "arguments": "He has approached this Court challenging a notice issued by the Executive Officer, Nagar Panchayat, Baberu, Banda dated 16.10.2023, which records that the activities undertaken by the petitioner are in contravention of the bye-laws framed by the Nagar Panchayat, as are notified in the Gazette on 17.07.2021."
  },
